  "description": "Beautiful Design\n\nThis bike has a stylishly designed, available in white, pink and purple and comes with a basket so your child can ride beautifully and comfortably\n\nBest Safety Protection\n\nAll our bikes are equipped with front v brake and coaster brake, ensures fast braking;\n\nChain guard and handlebar edge protection improve the safety of your child‘s’ riding\n\nFlexible and Adjustable\n\nThis bike can be adjusted over time to adapt the height of the handlebars and seat to your child's growth\n\n90% Pre-assembled\n\nThe bikes come 90% pre-assembled, so you only need to complete the simple assembly steps;\n\nThe tools required for assembly are included in the packaging\n\nAbout Us\n\nHILAND had a simple yet powerful mission — to bring the joy of cycling and a healthy, positive lifestyle to everyone. From the very beginning, HILAND set out to provide affordable, high-quality bicycles that would make the freedom of riding accessible to all.\n\nWe've got our own manufacturing facilities, so we ensure that each bike we make brings top-notch performance and affordability to our amazing customers.\n\nPetal is a Hiland bike designed for kids with child safety fully in mind. The bright painted frame and beautiful floral pattern could quickly catch the attention of little kids and delight them. It is easy to handle and quick to learn, which helps to foster your kid's riding confidence. Let your little lady ride Petal to the park or around the neighborhood with friends and family for a happy and relaxing time!",
